<title>NETHERLANDS: AHOLD 1996 Q4 NET PROFIT DFL 216.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>AHOLD 1996 Q4 NET PROFIT DFL 216.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>ZAANDAM, Netherlands 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4 1996</p>
